HbBKJEMQ3YcHCMcCKAA"]],1],null,null,"等待時間",null,"0ahUKEwjX9ev0vdKWAxWJUPUHHbBKJEMQ3IcHCMYCKAg",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["魚介醬油拉麵\n湯頭沒有深度，僅有一點柴魚味的醬油湯頭。筍乾味很怪，混著類似咖啡味在裡面。加點的半熟玉子，熟度還算不錯，但不夠入味。麵體類似一包89元兩入包裝的拉麵麵體，不好不壞。\n\n家系豚骨拉麵\n香味雞油、麵的硬度、湯頭鹹味皆可調整，都選正常卻偏鹹又偏油。麵的口感有嚼勁，還算不錯。叉燒在湯頭的比較下，淡然無味。海苔裹著湯，彷彿吃了一口混著油的鹽巴。可以吃出老闆對家系拉麵的理解，但很顯然跟我理解的家系不太一樣，簡言之，不合我口味，麵跟湯都只吃一半就沒再吃了。\n\n明太子奶油生蛋拌飯\n等這一碗等了20多分鐘。明太子有先炙燒，但有點燒過頭了，反倒有焦味，但這一碗反而是唯一吃完的餐點，不是因為這碗好吃，而是另外兩碗......\n\n五顆星：非吃不可\n四顆星：路過可吃\n三顆星：普普通通\n**二顆星：差強人意**\n一顆星：加油好嗎",null,[0,89]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/9865792926643707628/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjV3TmxGcWF6UlVWbkJOVXpCMFZsWkZXbGxWTW1oUldETnJlVmRYWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/9865792926643707628/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjV3TmxGcWF6UlVWbkJOVXpCMFZsWkZXbGxWTW1oUldETnJlVmRYWXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/9865792926643707628/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjV3TmxGcWF6UlVWbkJOVXpCMFZsWkZXbGxWTW1oUldETnJlVmRYWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/9865792926643707628/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjV3TmxGcWF6UlVWbkJOVXpCMFZsWkZXbGxWTW1oUldETnJlVmRYWXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/9865792926643707628/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjV3TmxGcWF6UlVWbkJOVXpCMFZsWkZXbGxWTW1oUldETnJlVmRYWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/9865792926643707628/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjV3TmxGcWF6UlVWbkJOVXpCMFZsWkZXbGxWTW1oUldETnJlVmRYWXhBQhAA"]],[null,null,17988,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25wNlFqazRUVnBNUzB0VlZFWllVMmhRWDNreVdXYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xbc1ec1a1f41996c0!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOnp6Qjk4TVpMS0tVVEZYU2hQX3kyWWc%7C%7C?hl\u003d